Hi Avery,

Here's what's new in Slack for tessera.slack.com this month.

Slack AI, now in every paid plan
Daily channel recaps, thread summaries, and search that answers questions instead of returning links. Turn it on for your workspace under Settings > Slack AI.

Lists
Track work without leaving Slack. Create a list from any message, assign owners, set due dates, and see everything in one table view.

Canvas templates
Weekly team updates, incident runbooks, and meeting notes, all with prefilled sections.

Activity view
One place for mentions, reactions, and thread replies, so your sidebar stays quiet.

See the full list: https://email.slack.com/l/whats-new-0831

